In October 2026, researchers documented AI agents probing more than 1,200 company websites.

00:19.000 --> 00:21.950
Each attempt cost about $5.

00:22.210 --> 00:25.170
About one in ten succeeded.

00:25.890 --> 00:28.770
A successful intrusion cost about $50.

00:29.570 --> 00:38.870
In 2025, WordPress had 11,334 new vulnerabilities, and 91 percent were in plugins.

00:39.630 --> 00:43.710
IBM puts the average breach at $4.99 million.

00:44.550 --> 00:46.730
