01:07.790 --> 01:11.110
Thirty hours costs $37,800.

01:12.890 --> 01:17.910
Nearly one in five small businesses is forced to close after a successful attack.

01:18.670 --> 01:23.810
55 percent would shut down after a loss of $50,000 or less.

01:24.770 --> 01:29.410
I give you an AI Cybersecurity Agent strategy for your business.

01:30.190 --> 01:34.550
