01:38.050 --> 01:41.090
No page limit, no tier that cuts you off.

01:41.750 --> 01:43.390
Predict checks versions daily.

01:44.250 --> 01:46.150
I pre-authorize six actions:

01:46.810 --> 01:53.290
restore a known malware file from backup, quarantine it first, block one attacking address,

01:53.990 --> 02:01.030
block a SQL injection request, apply a virtual patch, and roll back a fix that broke the site.

02:01.040 --> 02:06.590
I get immediate notification for every action, and you get automated reporting.

02:07.430 --> 02:09.230
Everything else waits for my check.

02:10.370 --> 02:11.510
