02:12.350 --> 02:17.070
One address sent 120 requests to my test law firm site.

02:17.790 --> 02:23.210
The agent let the first 100 through and blocked that address at request 101.

02:23.990 --> 02:26.950
The office stayed open for everyone else.

02:27.690 --> 02:34.650
Earlier, the agent restored a known malware file and confirmed the site clean in about 3 seconds.

02:35.770 --> 02:42.630
Six hours down costs $7,560 in that same example, before the cleanup.

02:43.250 --> 02:46.830
That is why one serious hack can cost more than the build.

02:47.630 --> 02:49.670
I protect your site for the long run.

02:50.510 --> 02:55.890
Third parties sell the same service to everyone and respond in 6 to 30 hours.

02:56.830 --> 03:01.050
My AI Cybersecurity Agent is designed for your business alone.

03:01.830 --> 03:03.050
It is your strategy.

03:03.950 --> 03:15.950
It monitors your site day and night, blocks attacks as they happen, scans every page with no tier and no page limit, and restores a hacked file in about 3 seconds.

03:16.570 --> 03:18.890
